sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Job as Migration job
    participant Command as Command
    participant Service as Service
    participant Repository as Repository
    participant Selector as Selector
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Job->>+DB: apply the migrations, then end
    DB-->>-Job: done, or a failure that stops the deployment
    Command->>+Service: a method in the application's language
    Service->>+Repository: SelectBy(a named specification)
    Repository-->>-Service: a selector, no statement run
    Service->>+Selector: Count, First, Update, Delete
    Selector->>+DB: one question, or one save
    DB-->>-Selector: rows, or a failure
    Selector-->>-Service: rows, or duplicate key, row changed, unavailable
    Service-->>-Command: entities, or conflict, concurrent change, unavailable
